        "official_en_sha256": "4fba329293348f9a81f9329dea45ee153c0976459037fb4c93e07c2120c10b47"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前ほどの力ならば\r\n八賢者を相手にしてもやれるはずだ。",
        "official_en": "I believe that, with your abilities, you can subdue them.",
        "real_en": "With your strength, you should be able to take on even the Eight Sages."
      },
