      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ちょうどいい。\r\n前に話したヘスとの和平についてだが\r\nそのことで頼みたいことがあるのだ。",
        "official_en": "You came at a good time. Remember our conversation about peace earlier? I have something to ask of you related to that.",
        "real_en": null
      },
