        "official_en_sha256": "c6e065681b6a78d34eb7cc34112646c9299b6fd0c21791abe07357a773134cd4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "では、このクリスタルを預けよう。\r\nこれを使えばヘスの八賢者を封印できる。",
        "official_en": "Here, take this Crystal. It has the power to seal one of the Eight Sages.",
        "real_en": "Here, I'll entrust you with this Crystal. You can use it to seal the Eight Sages of Hess."
